/**
 * ==========================================================================
 * RUN FROM THE PRINCIPAL! - Endless Hallway Runner Game
 * ==========================================================================
 * HTML5 Canvas + Vanilla JavaScript. No external libraries or build step.
 * Pseudo-3D corridor projection with 3 lanes, cartoon characters, procedural
 * obstacle spawning, collectibles, power-ups, particle systems, and procedural
 * Web Audio API synthesizer for all sound effects and music.
 */

